{"seq":1,"slug":"generics-deep-dive","title":"泛型深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/swift-language-advanced/type-system/generics-deep-dive","wordCount":1073,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"泛型深入\">泛型深入</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>泛型（Generics）是 Swift 类型系统中最强大的特性之一，它允许开发者编写灵活、可复用的函数和类型，同时保持完整的类型安全。Swift 标准库大量使用泛型——<code>Array&lt;Element&gt;</code>、<code>Dictionary&lt;Key, Value&gt;</code>、<code>Optional&lt;Wrapped&gt;</code> 都是泛型类型的经典范例。</p>\n<p>掌握泛型的高级用法，包括类型约束、<code>where</code> 子句和特化机制，是编写高质量 Swift 代码的基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    G[&quot;泛型 Generics&quot;] --&gt; GF[&quot;泛型函数&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; GT[&quot;泛型类型&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; TC[&quot;类型约束&quot;]&#10;    TC --&gt; PC[&quot;协议约束&quot;]&#10;    TC --&gt; CC[&quot;类约束&quot;]&#10;    TC --&gt; WC[&quot;where 子句&quot;]&#10;    GT --&gt; SP[&quot;泛型特化&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    G[\"泛型 Generics\"] --&gt; GF[\"泛型函数\"]\n    G --&gt; GT[\"泛型类型\"]\n    G --&gt; TC[\"类型约束\"]\n    TC --&gt; PC[\"协议约束\"]\n    TC --&gt; CC[\"类约束\"]\n    TC --&gt; WC[\"where 子句\"]\n    GT --&gt; SP[\"泛型特化\"]</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>泛型的本质是把「类型」本身变成可延迟确定的参数：用类型参数（<code>&lt;T&gt;</code>）作占位符，把具体类型的决定权从定义处推迟到调用处。围绕这条主线，Swift 泛型由四个相互配合的机制构成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>类型参数</strong>——泛型函数、泛型类型（struct/class/enum）承载占位符，调用时由编译器推断具体类型；</li>\n<li><strong>单态化（Monomorphization）</strong>——编译器为每个具体类型生成独立实现，使泛型代码获得与手写特定类型代码相同的性能；</li>\n<li><strong>类型约束</strong>——协议约束、类约束、组合约束限定类型参数可以执行的操作；</li>\n<li><strong>where 子句</strong>——表达关联类型相等、多类型参数关系等更精细的约束；</li>\n<li><strong>泛型特化</strong>——编译器在能确定具体类型时生成的优化版本，跨模块需要 <code>@inlinable</code> 辅助。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解「类型参数是占位符，约束决定可用操作，特化决定性能」这条主线，即可贯通本主题的全部机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"泛型函数\">泛型函数</h2><p>泛型函数使用**类型参数（Type Parameter）**作为占位符，在调用时由编译器自动推断具体类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func swapValues&lt;T&gt;(_ a: inout T, _ b: inout T) {&#10;    let temp = a&#10;    a = b&#10;    b = temp&#10;}&#10;&#10;var x = 10, y = 20&#10;swapValues(&amp;x, &amp;y)&#10;&#10;var s1 = &quot;hello&quot;, s2 = &quot;world&quot;&#10;swapValues(&amp;s1, &amp;s2)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> swapValues</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">inout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">inout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, y </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">swapValues</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"hello\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, s2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"world\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">swapValues</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">s1, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">s2)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器会对每个具体类型生成独立的函数实现，这个过程叫做<strong>单态化（Monomorphization）</strong>，它确保泛型代码具有与手写特定类型代码相同的性能。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"泛型类型\">泛型类型</h2><p>泛型不仅适用于函数，也可以定义泛型结构体、类和枚举：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct Stack&lt;Element&gt; {&#10;    private var storage: [Element] = []&#10;&#10;    var isEmpty: Bool { storage.isEmpty }&#10;    var count: Int { storage.count }&#10;&#10;    mutating func push(_ element: Element) {&#10;        storage.append(element)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    mutating func pop() -&gt; Element? {&#10;        storage.popLast()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func peek() -&gt; Element? {&#10;        storage.last&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;var intStack = Stack&lt;Int&gt;()&#10;intStack.push(1)&#10;intStack.push(2)&#10;&#10;var stringStack = Stack&lt;String&gt;()&#10;stringStack.push(&quot;Swift&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stack</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> storage: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isEmpty: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isEmpty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    mutating</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(element)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    mutating</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">popLast</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> peek</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">last</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intStack </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Stack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">intStack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">intStack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stringStack </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Stack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stringStack.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Swift\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>泛型类型还可以拥有多个类型参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct Pair&lt;First, Second&gt; {&#10;    let first: First&#10;    let second: Second&#10;}&#10;&#10;let pair = Pair(first: &quot;age&quot;, second: 30)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Pair</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">First</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Second</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> first: First</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> second: Second</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pair </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Pair</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">first</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">second</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型约束\">类型约束</h2><p>无约束的类型参数 <code>T</code> 只能执行所有类型通用的操作。通过<strong>类型约束</strong>，可以要求类型参数遵循特定协议或继承特定类：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func findIndex&lt;T: Equatable&gt;(of value: T, in array: [T]) -&gt; Int? {&#10;    for (index, element) in array.enumerated() {&#10;        if element == value {&#10;            return index&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    return nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> findIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Equatable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value: T, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> array: [T]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (index, element) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> array.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">enumerated</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> index</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束形式</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>协议约束</td>\n<td><code>T: Equatable</code></td>\n<td>T 必须遵循 Equatable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类约束</td>\n<td><code>T: UIView</code></td>\n<td>T 必须是 UIView 或其子类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合约束</td>\n<td><code>T: Hashable &amp; Codable</code></td>\n<td>T 必须同时遵循多个协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>父类+协议</td>\n<td><code>T: UIView &amp; Drawable</code></td>\n<td>T 继承 UIView 且遵循 Drawable</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"where-子句\">where 子句</h2><p><code>where</code> 子句提供更精细的类型约束表达能力，可以约束关联类型、多类型参数之间的关系等：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"func merge&lt;C1: Collection, C2: Collection&gt;(&#10;    _ c1: C1,&#10;    _ c2: C2&#10;) -&gt; [C1.Element] where C1.Element == C2.Element, C1.Element: Comparable {&#10;    (Array(c1) + Array(c2)).sorted()&#10;}&#10;&#10;let result = merge([3, 1], [4, 2])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">C1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Collection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">C2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Collection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    _</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c1: C1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    _</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c2: C2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [C1.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> C1.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> C2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, C1.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Comparable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c1) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c2)).</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>where</code> 子句也可以用在扩展上，为泛型类型在特定条件下添加额外功能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"extension Stack where Element: Equatable {&#10;    func contains(_ element: Element) -&gt; Bool {&#10;        storage.contains(element)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;extension Stack where Element: Numeric {&#10;    func sum() -&gt; Element {&#10;        storage.reduce(0, +)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extension</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> where</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Equatable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> contains</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">contains</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(element)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">extension</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Stack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> where</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Element</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        storage.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    W[&quot;where 子句&quot;] --&gt; E1[&quot;Element == 约束&quot;]&#10;    W --&gt; E2[&quot;Element: Protocol 约束&quot;]&#10;    W --&gt; E3[&quot;多参数关系约束&quot;]&#10;    W --&gt; E4[&quot;扩展条件约束&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    W[\"where 子句\"] --&gt; E1[\"Element == 约束\"]\n    W --&gt; E2[\"Element: Protocol 约束\"]\n    W --&gt; E3[\"多参数关系约束\"]\n    W --&gt; E4[\"扩展条件约束\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"泛型特化\">泛型特化</h2><p>Swift 编译器通过**泛型特化（Generic Specialization）**优化性能。当编译器能够确定泛型的具体类型时，会生成针对该类型优化的代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@_specialize(where T == Int)&#10;func heavyComputation&lt;T: Numeric&gt;(_ value: T) -&gt; T {&#10;    var result = value&#10;    for _ in 0..&lt;1000 {&#10;        result = result + value&#10;    }&#10;    return result&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@_specialize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> heavyComputation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value: T) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> _</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">..&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>@_specialize</code> 是 Swift 的内部属性，一般不需要手动添加。编译器在开启优化（<code>-O</code>）时会自动执行特化。了解特化机制有助于理解泛型的性能特征。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>泛型特化的层级关系：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    GC[&quot;泛型代码(未特化)&quot;] --&gt;|编译器优化| SP[&quot;特化代码&quot;]&#10;    SP --&gt; INT[&quot;Int 特化版本&quot;]&#10;    SP --&gt; STR[&quot;String 特化版本&quot;]&#10;    SP --&gt; CUS[&quot;自定义类型特化版本&quot;]&#10;    GC --&gt;|跨模块调用| WT[&quot;使用 witness table 间接调用&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    GC[\"泛型代码(未特化)\"] --&gt;|编译器优化| SP[\"特化代码\"]\n    SP --&gt; INT[\"Int 特化版本\"]\n    SP --&gt; STR[\"String 特化版本\"]\n    SP --&gt; CUS[\"自定义类型特化版本\"]\n    GC --&gt;|跨模块调用| WT[\"使用 witness table 间接调用\"]</pre><p>跨模块边界的泛型调用默认无法特化，因为编译器看不到具体类型。使用 <code>@inlinable</code> 可以暴露函数体，允许跨模块特化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@inlinable&#10;public func fastMap&lt;T, U&gt;(_ array: [T], transform: (T) -&gt; U) -&gt; [U] {&#10;    var result = [U]()&#10;    result.reserveCapacity(array.count)&#10;    for element in array {&#10;        result.append(transform(element))&#10;    }&#10;    return result&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@inlinable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fastMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">U</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> array: [T], </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (T) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> U) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [U] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [U]()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reserveCapacity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(array.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> array {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(element))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"泛型与协议的配合\">泛型与协议的配合</h2><p>泛型和协议结合使用能发挥更大的威力。典型模式是定义协议约束，再通过泛型函数统一处理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"protocol Serializable {&#10;    func serialize() -&gt; Data&#10;    static func deserialize(from data: Data) throws -&gt; Self&#10;}&#10;&#10;func saveToFile&lt;T: Serializable&gt;(_ object: T, path: String) throws {&#10;    let data = object.serialize()&#10;    try data.write(to: URL(fileURLWithPath: path))&#10;}&#10;&#10;func loadFromFile&lt;T: Serializable&gt;(path: String) throws -&gt; T {&#10;    let data = try Data(contentsOf: URL(fileURLWithPath: path))&#10;    return try T.deserialize(from: data)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">protocol</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Serializable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> serialize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    static</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deserialize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data: Data) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Self</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> saveToFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Serializable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> object: T, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> object.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">serialize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">write</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fileURLWithPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: path))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loadFromFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Serializable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">throws</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">contentsOf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fileURLWithPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: path))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> try</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> T.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">deserialize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>泛型函数</strong>使用类型参数作为占位符，编译器通过单态化生成具体类型的代码</li>\n<li><strong>泛型类型</strong>（struct、class、enum）可以拥有一个或多个类型参数，实现容器等通用数据结构</li>\n<li><strong>类型约束</strong>通过协议约束、类约束或组合约束限定类型参数的能力</li>\n<li><strong>where 子句</strong>提供细粒度的约束表达，支持关联类型约束和多参数关系约束</li>\n<li><strong>泛型特化</strong>是编译器优化手段，在确定具体类型时生成高效代码；跨模块需要 <code>@inlinable</code> 辅助</li>\n<li>泛型与协议结合是 Swift 类型系统的核心设计模式，二者协作实现类型安全的多态</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"泛型深入","id":"泛型深入"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"泛型函数","id":"泛型函数"},{"level":2,"text":"泛型类型","id":"泛型类型"},{"level":2,"text":"类型约束","id":"类型约束"},{"level":2,"text":"where 子句","id":"where-子句"},{"level":2,"text":"泛型特化","id":"泛型特化"},{"level":2,"text":"泛型与协议的配合","id":"泛型与协议的配合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"关联类型","u